{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":5589044,"ns":0,"title":"Antireductionism","extract":"Antireductionism is the position in science and metaphysics that stands in contrast to reductionism (anti-holism) by advocating that not all properties of a system can be explained in terms of its constituent parts and their interactions.","description":"Concept in philosophy and psychology","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}